          "title": "LSx 1999-2014 Chevy and GMC Truck",
          "text": "Nothing lasts forever, not even a classic GM small block. When it's time for something new, consider a turnkey Chevy crate engine. We specialize in LSx engines for 1999-2014 Chevy trucks: short block, long block, and complete. If you seek a quality LSx crate motor for sale, you've come to the right place.",
